    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/3f0df2f57891af5ede80f44a3357f3ff.avif?t=1753217475\" data-has-big width=800 height=158 /></span><strong>Have you ever yearned for an adventure 'cross the far seas........ with yer cats?</strong><br><br><br>Purrates is an adventurous point &amp; click mystery focused on the tale of a pirate cat crew.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/6841c9fdf80cacd0a8b21c3835b77df6.avif?t=1753217475\" data-has-big width=800 height=296 /></span><strong>Experience the epic tale of the Purrates crew on their valiant quest to discover the mystery of the Red Dot! </strong><br> <br><strong> </strong><br>  <br>Talk to the local residents - the harbor workers may know a few things about the island and where to find supplies.<strong> </strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/b385d69bdbb9073aa203f39f7e36238a.poster.avif?t=1753217475\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/b385d69bdbb9073aa203f39f7e36238a.webm?t=1753217475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/b385d69bdbb9073aa203f39f7e36238a.mp4?t=1753217475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Explore the harbor, town square &amp; tavern while chatting with fellow purrates to learn more about this great mystery...... </strong> <br>  <br><strong> </strong> <br>  <br>Take your time to soak in the atmosphere and get immersed in the pirate setting!<strong> </strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/9ba9270e875602fda3b5cd7384af94a8.poster.avif?t=1753217475\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/9ba9270e875602fda3b5cd7384af94a8.webm?t=1753217475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/9ba9270e875602fda3b5cd7384af94a8.mp4?t=1753217475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Immerse yerself in the cat-pirate world of Purrates!</strong>   <br><br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/36c1c83c6447f45e1ebf0d1e1ced0638.avif?t=1753217475\" data-has-big width=800 height=1494 /></span><br><i>Comic book panel art by Jordan Deemi</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/3f0df2f57891af5ede80f44a3357f3ff.avif?t=1753217475\" data-has-big width=800 height=158 /></span><strong>Have you ever yearned for an adventure 'cross the far seas........ with yer cats?</strong><br><br><br>Purrates is an adventurous point &amp; click mystery focused on the tale of a pirate cat crew.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/6841c9fdf80cacd0a8b21c3835b77df6.avif?t=1753217475\" data-has-big width=800 height=296 /></span><strong>Experience the epic tale of the Purrates crew on their valiant quest to discover the mystery of the Red Dot! </strong><br> <br><strong> </strong><br>  <br>Talk to the local residents - the harbor workers may know a few things about the island and where to find supplies.<strong> </strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/b385d69bdbb9073aa203f39f7e36238a.poster.avif?t=1753217475\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/b385d69bdbb9073aa203f39f7e36238a.webm?t=1753217475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/b385d69bdbb9073aa203f39f7e36238a.mp4?t=1753217475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Explore the harbor, town square &amp; tavern while chatting with fellow purrates to learn more about this great mystery...... </strong> <br>  <br><strong> </strong> <br>  <br>Take your time to soak in the atmosphere and get immersed in the pirate setting!<strong> </strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/9ba9270e875602fda3b5cd7384af94a8.poster.avif?t=1753217475\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/9ba9270e875602fda3b5cd7384af94a8.webm?t=1753217475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/9ba9270e875602fda3b5cd7384af94a8.mp4?t=1753217475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Immerse yerself in the cat-pirate world of Purrates!</strong>   <br><br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/36c1c83c6447f45e1ebf0d1e1ced0638.avif?t=1753217475\" data-has-big width=800 height=1494 /></span><br><i>Comic book panel art by Jordan Deemi</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Purrates is a point &amp; click adventure about cat pirates resolving a great mystery. Embrace the pirate's duties with captain Clawdius Whiskers &amp; reassemble your ship's crew! Every cat for themselves! Craft items to solve various puzzles &amp; win back the favor of your fellow purrates! Yarrr!",
